# Candidate shared Windows NVIDIA runtime for MRT2 and Stable Audio 3.
#
# Stable Audio 3's immutable upstream source pins torch/torchaudio 2.7.1 and
# requires huggingface-hub >=1.7.1.  MRT2's adapter surface is model-free tested
# against this one environment, but the candidate remains release-blocked until
# both models complete the physical-GPU qualification matrix in issue #114.
